%% UMIS target enterprise architecture — see 19_Future_Architecture.md
flowchart TB
    subgraph Presentation[Presentation layer]
        DS[Design System + shared UI package]
        Shells[Role shells + feature UIs]
        APIClient[Typed API client + data hooks]
        DS --> Shells
        Shells --> APIClient
    end
    subgraph API[API layer - versioned]
        Handlers[Thin route handlers /api/v1/**]
        DTO[DTO + shared Zod validation]
        Handlers --> DTO
    end
    subgraph Domain[Domain / application layer]
        Kernel[Shared contributor-module KERNEL<br/>eliminates 6x duplication]
        Modules[Feature modules - DDD bounded contexts]
        Policy[Central authorization policy]
        Events[Domain events]
        Kernel --> Modules
        Modules --> Policy
        Modules --> Events
    end
    subgraph Infra[Infrastructure layer]
        Repos[Repository pattern - abstracts Mongoose]
        Queue[Job queue - reminders/PDF/metric gen]
        Notify[Notification service]
        Audit[Transactional audit]
        Storage[Storage adapter - Firebase/S3]
    end
    Data[(MongoDB)]
    APIClient -->|HTTPS| Handlers
    DTO --> Modules
    Modules --> Repos
    Events --> Queue
    Events --> Notify
    Modules --> Audit
    Repos --> Data
    Modules --> Storage
